      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Veteran Memorial Building in Lehi began as a World War I memorial and later housed a library, courthouse, jail, police station, and fire station.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
